  "title": "About the control connector of IPMM15B",
  "content": "<p>I am connecting IPMM15B’s J2 to IHM09M2's J7. There are  documents showing how J7 is aligned and where it is situated on the board. But I have no idea how J2 is oriented. The schematic is too brief. It could be opposite aligned if I turned the board around to the inverse side. I don’t know how the pins should be connected.</p><p> </p><p>I need to know where pin1 pin2 is situated on the board.</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/67d2b7c1-f185-44a4-a5c7-a0a91a233f96.png\" /></figure><p> </p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/733e8757-ac99-47c9-90c5-8f7ff95ddeb5.png\" /></figure><p> </p>",
